WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.237
Mom was taking Oliver to the dentist.

2
00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:11.513
Dad was taking Harry and Emmy shopping.

3
00:00:11.514 --> 00:00:15.746
"Let's meet at the park at eleven o'clock," Mom said.

4
00:00:15.747 --> 00:00:19.520
"If we're early, we'll wait at the playground."

5
00:00:19.521 --> 00:00:27.382
"If we're early, we'll wait at the creek," Dad said.

6
00:00:27.383 --> 00:00:31.830
Oliver and Mom arrived a few minutes late.

7
00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:35.252
They walked along the edge of the creek.

8
00:00:35.253 --> 00:00:40.615
But they didn't see Dad and the kids.

9
00:00:40.616 --> 00:00:47.239
"Maybe they're waiting at the playground," Oliver said.

10
00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:51.900
But there was no sign of them there.

11
00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:57.980
Oliver played on the swings and the slide.

12
00:00:57.981 --> 00:01:03.807
Then he and Mom checked the creek again.

13
00:01:03.808 --> 00:01:10.435
Oliver tossed stones into the water.

14
00:01:10.436 --> 00:01:14.067
"Where are they?" Mom asked.

15
00:01:14.068 --> 00:01:20.281
"Let's check the playground again," Oliver said.

16
00:01:20.282 --> 00:01:30.890
He climbed to the top of the slide.

17
00:01:30.891 --> 00:01:35.400
"I don't see them," Oliver called.

18
00:01:35.401 --> 00:01:41.632
"Maybe they gave up and went home."

19
00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:49.151
"This is only a small park," Mom said.

20
00:01:49.152 --> 00:01:52.851
"I don't understand why we didn't meet up."

21
00:01:52.852 --> 00:01:58.878
"Unless they're at a different park?" Oliver asked.

22
00:01:58.879 --> 00:02:04.978
Mom texted Dad, and then she laughed.

23
00:02:04.979 --> 00:02:08.833
"You're right, Oliver," she said.

24
00:02:08.834 --> 00:02:14.178
"Dad says we'll meet up in ten minutes."

25
00:02:14.179 --> 00:02:17.100
Oliver scratched his head.

26
00:02:17.101 --> 00:02:25.727
"At the creek or the playground?" he asked.

